#: ../../source/docs/poshold-mode.rst:5 6e69d6bc61f94f3d9b47bcbc4c7b16d9
msgid "PosHold Mode"
msgstr "PosHold 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/poshold-mode.rst:7 d4b32946f18c481eb9cf827b5ac46d63
msgid ""
"The PosHold flight mode is similar to :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` in that "
"when the transmitter sticks are centered the vehicle maintains a constant "
"location, heading, and altitude.  The major difference is that the pilot's "
"roll and pitch inputs directly control the vehicle's lean angle."
msgstr ""
"PosHold 飞行模式与 :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` "
"类似，当遥控器摇杆居中时，飞行器保持固定位置、航向和高度。主要区别在于飞手的横滚和俯仰输入直接控制飞行器的倾斜角度。"

#: ../../source/docs/poshold-mode.rst:11 419d1e670e284bd1842885e2295993a7
msgid "In general :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` is recommended over PosHold."
msgstr "通常推荐使用 :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` 而非 PosHold。"

#: ../../source/docs/poshold-mode.rst:14 a4da205ebf5a49488892d913be3819be
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/poshold-mode.rst:16 96d1a0805dd84148a14ebf4b34c8acdc
msgid ""
"When switched on, PosHold mode will automatically attempts to maintain the "
"current location, heading and altitude. Good GPS position, :ref:`low "
"magnetic interference on the compass <common-diagnosing-problems-using-"
"logs_compass_interference>`\\ and :ref:`low vibrations <common-diagnosing-"
"problems-using-logs_vibrations>` are all important in achieving good loiter "
"performance."
msgstr ""
"切换到 PosHold 模式后，飞行器将自动尝试维持当前位置、航向和高度。良好的 GPS 定位、:ref:`罗盘低磁场干扰 <common-"
"diagnosing-problems-using-logs_compass_interference>`\\ 以及 :ref:`低震动 "
"<common-diagnosing-problems-using-logs_vibrations>` 对于实现良好的定点性能都至关重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/poshold-mode.rst:25 642226b5310746c3a5951d7260c1510e
msgid "Controls"
msgstr "控制"

#: ../../source/docs/poshold-mode.rst:27 cb767ed5e782428f8d0254b491392ce1
msgid ""
"The pilot can control the copter's location horizontally and vertically with"
" the control sticks."
msgstr "飞手可以通过控制摇杆在水平和垂直方向上控制飞行器的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/poshold-mode.rst:30 62be73f358d74177b9a0210b78d80f49
msgid ""
"Horizontal location can be adjusted with the Roll and Pitch control sticks "
"with the default maximum lean angle being 45 degrees (angle can be adjusted "
"with the :ref:`ANGLE_MAX<ANGLE_MAX>` parameter). When the pilot releases the"
" sticks the copter will lean back to bring the vehicle to a stop."
msgstr ""
"水平位置可通过横滚和俯仰控制摇杆进行调整，默认最大倾斜角度为 45 度（可通过 :ref:`ANGLE_MAX<ANGLE_MAX>` "
"参数调整）。当飞手松开摇杆时，飞行器将向后倾斜以使飞行器停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/poshold-mode.rst:35 154b37a9215c46e1b2533170e5277a11
msgid ""
"Altitude can be controlled with the Throttle control stick just as in "
":ref:`AltHold mode <altholdmode_controls>`"
msgstr "高度可通过油门控制摇杆进行控制，与 :ref:`AltHold模式 <altholdmode_controls>` 相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/poshold-mode.rst:37 486ecbab220f46b787c5b2c9b52604cb
msgid "The heading can be set with the Yaw control stick"
msgstr "航向可通过偏航控制摇杆设定。"

#: ../../source/docs/poshold-mode.rst:38 ac7b510e3ed548feb3c1b7e19756e8eb
msgid ""
"You may arm in PosHold mode but only once the GPS has 3D lock and the HDOP "
"has dropped to 2.0 or lower."
msgstr "可以在 PosHold 模式下解锁，但前提是 GPS 已获得 3D 定位锁定且 HDOP 降至 2.0 或更低。"

#: ../../source/docs/poshold-mode.rst:41 e7da85ee743241759ce3e5f29e19caab
msgid ""
"On a Pixhawk the LED will become green (:ref:`more details on LED patterns "
"here <common-apm-board-leds>`)."
msgstr ""
"在 Pixhawk 上，LED 指示灯将变为绿色（:ref:`此处查看更多 LED 灯光模式详情 <common-apm-board-leds>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/poshold-mode.rst:43 5754e9e79376415f86235b3df44994b4
msgid ""
"The HDOP value can be made clearly visible through the mission planner's "
"Quick screen by double clicking and then selecting \"gpshdop\" from the "
"large grid of checkboxes."
msgstr "可通过在 Mission Planner 的快速屏幕上双击，然后从大型复选框网格中选择「gpshdop」来清晰显示 HDOP 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/poshold-mode.rst:50 72a5b9d819f945ae85e552fd9251cfc8
msgid ""
"The maximum brake-angle can be set with the "
":ref:`PHLD_BRAKE_ANGLE<PHLD_BRAKE_ANGLE>` parameter (i.e. 3000 = the vehicle"
" will lean back up to 30degrees)"
msgstr ""
"最大制动角度可通过 :ref:`PHLD_BRAKE_ANGLE<PHLD_BRAKE_ANGLE>` 参数设置（例如 3000 表示飞行器最多向后倾斜"
" 30 度）"

#: ../../source/docs/poshold-mode.rst:52 45304b78058d4e3197f0171fde784a70
msgid ""
"The speed the vehicle rotates back to the maximum angle can be set with the "
":ref:`PHLD_BRAKE_RATE<PHLD_BRAKE_RATE>` parameter (i.e. 8 = rotates back at "
"8 degrees per second))"
msgstr ""
"飞行器旋转回最大角度的速度可通过 :ref:`PHLD_BRAKE_RATE<PHLD_BRAKE_RATE>` 参数设置（例如 8 表示以每秒 8 "
"度的速度回转）"
